{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_101_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，王正月，王使榮叔歸含且賵。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"含，一事也。賵，一事也。兼歸之，非正也。其曰且，志兼也。其不言來，不周事之用也。賵以早，而含以晚。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"二、三月，辛亥，葬我小君成風。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"三、王使毛伯來會葬。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"會葬之禮於鄙上。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"四、夏，公孫敖如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"五、秦人入鄀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚人滅六。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_101_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_101","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，甲申，許男業卒。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}